IMPLEMENTATION NOTES
--------------------
- RestClient.Builder injected into SupabaseAuthService (Spring Boot auto-configures it)
- Supabase Admin API filter is a text search; exact email match done in Java after fetch
- PostgreSQL BIGSERIAL used for auto-increment columns (replaces MySQL AUTO_INCREMENT)
- Temp-data migration resets sequences after explicit-ID inserts via setval()
- NextAuth credentials provider: Supabase tokens don't auto-refresh — acceptable for concept
- API gateway: no code change needed; JWK URI overridden via SPRING_SECURITY_OAUTH2_RESOURCESERVER_JWT_JWK-SET-URI env var in docker-compose
- docker-compose entrypoints updated to wait for postgres_app_db:5432 instead of mysql_core_db:3306


